  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Junkyard Love Podcast."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2240,
    "dDurationMs": 4279,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " At what age do we learn how to be a better ..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6519,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " conversation?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7599,
    "dDurationMs": 1741,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " Junkyard Love Podcast."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9340,
    "dDurationMs": 1959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, what I would love to do, Wendy, welcome."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11460,
    "dDurationMs": 1899,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " Welcome to the show, welcome to the Junkyard Love Podcast."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13420,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " Thank you again for doing this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14560,
    "dDurationMs": 9239,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " Um, we have just briefly mentioned your new podcast, uh, Demystifying the Transgender Journey, I think is the name of it, correct me if I'm wrong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24039,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " But I would love, um..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25559,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " The link to that is gonna be below, anybody who wants to check that out, follow that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29119,
    "dDurationMs": 3119,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " But I would love a little bit of a background bio on that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32238,
    "dDurationMs": 1202,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " What, what, what is that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33619,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " What have you been working on?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34839,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " Um, tell us all about your new podcast."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37019,
    "dDurationMs": 4761,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, Jacob, thank you very much for mentioning all of this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41780,
    "dDurationMs": 9320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " I, I believe that I've star- I, I've, I've started on this path in 2015 when I started living my authentic self."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51100,
    "dDurationMs": 5379,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " I wound up talking with my neighbors, I talked with people, I..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56520,
    "dDurationMs": 13319,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " The community I lived in, um, there was a large gay population as well as cisgender straight people, and I wound up talking with everybody about what it means to be born transgender."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69839,
    "dDurationMs": 11940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " So, by 2022 or so, I started to get really highly annoyed at all the bullshit out there about people like myself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81779,
    "dDurationMs": 8060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " All the lies, all the misinformation, uh, the fostering fear and everything else."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89839,
    "dDurationMs": 19480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " I decided, \"Okay, if there's a way I can use my voice and all, I'll put, put something out there opposite of that.\" And I'd kind of like to actually inform regular straight society what this is about, those are the people that I wanna talk to."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 109319,
    "dDurationMs": 6220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " So, I got, uh, really interested and fascinated with podcasting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115539,
    "dDurationMs": 8380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " Uh, when I moved to Rhode Island, I hired an agency the s- second day I was in my apartment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123999,
    "dDurationMs": 9640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " I hired an agency to represent and promote me on podcast interviews, and that started my podcasting in the fall of 2023."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133639,
    "dDurationMs": 16820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " I met Lynn Murphy, a cisgender woman, knew very little about the LGBT world but was very fascinated with what it meant to be born transgender and she wanted to interview me for her podcast and a, and a book."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150459,
    "dDurationMs": 8780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " One thing led to another, we became friends, we've recorded a lot of video with me and we've recorded other people as well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 159239,
    "dDurationMs": 10740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " And by the spring of 2024, we'd did an agreement to co-host a brand new podcast called Demystifying the Transgender Journey."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169979,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " She's been like a sponge, absorbing everything I've told her, researching, talking to other people as well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178979,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " She's an accomplished author and podcaster of her, on her own rights."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182979,
    "dDurationMs": 6100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " And it's just been u- uh, an incredible collaboration."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189079,
    "dDurationMs": 17820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " And I've invited other transgender people to join me in a community that we're doing as well as the podcast, but the community is for straight and gay cisgender people who may have transgender people in their lives."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206899,
    "dDurationMs": 14380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " And a lot of people in the transgender commun- community, I, I understand this, I don't personally agree, for me, I'm open to answering questions people have."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 221279,
    "dDurationMs": 15380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " A lot of people are not comfortable with that, so even if you're friends with somebody, your friend who's transgender may not be open to having a conversation about what their life is like, how they feel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 236659,
    "dDurationMs": 10840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " A lot of people feel that it's, um, kind of a thing where you are being challenged to explain yourself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247499,
    "dDurationMs": 60,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm-hmm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247559,
    "dDurationMs": 260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " Mm-hmm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247819,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No matter how nice the person is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251279,
    "dDurationMs": 5540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " So, one of the things that I like to do with people is, \"Ask me anything you want to."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 256819,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " Don't worry about how you phrase it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 259099,
    "dDurationMs": 16460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " If it's phrased in such a way that I think is hurtful to another person or might mak- might make them uncomfortable or upset with you, I'll explain how to ask the question better.\" And that's how we learn to communicate with one another."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275559,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " We're, we're regular people, just like anybody else."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 280919,
    "dDurationMs": 520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right, right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 281439,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " You're just a person too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282999,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Exactly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 284279,
    "dDurationMs": 8480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " So, um, the whole podcast, the whole community, everything is oriented at..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 292759,
    "dDurationMs": 7480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " Now, my mission is to humanize being born transgender for the rest of society."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300239,
    "dDurationMs": 980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm-hmm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 301219,
    "dDurationMs": 7880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in order to do that, I'm doing that with conversations, with, uh, speaking with people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 309099,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " I've, uh, also added, this year I've added consulting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 313699,
    "dDurationMs": 7160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " My career in tech, I let- my last 18 years I was a consultant in technology."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 320939,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " Well, I can be a consultant on transgender too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 324279,
    "dDurationMs": 540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 324839,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " Hu- human technology as well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 326419,
    "dDurationMs": 1060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Exactly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 327479,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 328879,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, I, I love what I'm doing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 333119,
    "dDurationMs": 340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm-hmm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 333679,
    "dDurationMs": 8400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I also love, uh, coaching people and helping them through their transitions at whatever stage they're in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 342079,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " A lot of us are..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 344639,
    "dDurationMs": 6060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " I had tremendous limiting beliefs-"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 350699,
    "dDurationMs": 600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm-hmm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 351299,
    "dDurationMs": 40,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 351539,
    "dDurationMs": 8620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " about what was possible for me, and they were formed in childhood and all the way through my teenage years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 360159,
    "dDurationMs": 9420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " I had told my parents that I was a girl at age 10 , and that did not go well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 369579,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " I was threatened with being committed to a psychiatric facility and fixed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 374039,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm-hmm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 374839,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, I formed all of these beliefs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 377259,
    "dDurationMs": 12840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " Of course, when you're, when you're born, that's when the doctor looks and says, \"It's a boy,\" or, \"It's a girl.\" Well, that's just the physical sex, period."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 390099,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " That's the genitals for sexual, uh, reproduction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 393819,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " Has nothing to do with gender."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 396299,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " Gender's between the ears, not the legs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 398639,
    "dDurationMs": 7480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " Uh, gender is formed in the frontal cortex of the brain during the second trimester of birth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 406119,
    "dDurationMs": 8840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " The sex- uh, sexual orientation is also formed in the brain in the amygdala of the brain in the second trimester."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 414959,
    "dDurationMs": 7680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " And for most people, those are all totally congruent with what happened to the body physically."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 422639,
    "dDurationMs": 11060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " For some of us, myself included, I got a full dose of female in the frontal cortex of my brain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 433699,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " I knew it was there by age three and four."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 437499,
    "dDurationMs": 5620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " I felt different, I felt comfortable with other little girls, not with little boys."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 443119,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " It was just that simple."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 445679,
    "dDurationMs": 1420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " It's a feeling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 447099,
    "dDurationMs": 7640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " And you'll hear or read or whatever, uh, dysphoria."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454839,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " People are dysphoric, um, and all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 458019,
    "dDurationMs": 23155,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " What that really is, is that's the incongruence between how you feel, how your mind feels about who you really are versus when you're born and the doctor announces it's a boy or a girl, the socialization begins from that moment, from the parents, the immediate family...."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 481174,
    "dDurationMs": 4779,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " the extended family, it grows into the school system and your friends."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 485953,
    "dDurationMs": 10780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " And by the time you're five, six, seven, eight years old, you know you can't really express what you feel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 496733,
    "dDurationMs": 9520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " Because of the socialization you've experienced, you know how bad it is that, th- the way people feel about it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 506294,
    "dDurationMs": 639,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 507153,
    "dDurationMs": 11540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Uh, \"You can't be a girl, you were born a boy.\" Well, that's just the physical anatomy, it's not what's in your brain, it's not what..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 518693,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " how you were, uh, designed before birth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 522034,
    "dDurationMs": 1479,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right, right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 523513,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " Okay, so what i-..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 525633,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " I- I- I was, I was thinking about this, 'cause something, something that you said..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 529613,
    "dDurationMs": 7580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " So, so for one, just to lay a little groundwork be- before my question, something that you said that I really liked, and it was something I started this podcast with something in..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 537193,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " a similarity in mind, is that you often just go..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 540953,
    "dDurationMs": 6080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " you'll go to, you know, a bar or a restaurant and just sometimes sit down next to somebody and, and strike up a conversation-"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 547033,
    "dDurationMs": 620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm-hmm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 547653,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 547653,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
