  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5900351,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " that you don't think of."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5902131,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " But..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5903871,
    "dDurationMs": 7140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " And I made it over to the s- place where I put the, uh, cream and the sugar in, and all of that stuff."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5911151,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " And I'm looking around, is anybody paying attention to me?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5915571,
    "dDurationMs": 700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " No."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5916271,
    "dDurationMs": 8040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " I walked into therapy, \"Did it this week.\" \"Yep, you're ready.\" And that was it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5924311,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " I just knew that this was how it was going to be."
