  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6013671,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " Um, so, I've really had a great time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6015891,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " Um, I do want to send us off with a little bit of a bow tie."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6018651,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " Um, okay, how do I phrase this?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6022591,
    "dDurationMs": 6520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " I, I used to ask this question at the end of the podcast, like, what does the world need more of right now?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6029191,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " And it's such an open question that I feel like the..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6031831,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " It's, it kinda narrows you into, like, we need love."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6034291,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " This is the Junkyard Love Podcast."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6035971,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " But, um, with today's w-..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6039111,
    "dDurationMs": 13180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " Like, r- like, really right now, you know, the middle of, uh, March 2025, keeping in mind everything that's going on, bringing in your entire history of who you are, you've lived h- however many years on this planet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6052291,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " Bring all of it in to the present moment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6054791,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " What's useful for people to hear right now?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6058651,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6061931,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " What's useful for people?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6064071,
    "dDurationMs": 40,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " I would have to say it's all about possibilities."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6064111,
    "dDurationMs": 80,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " People are..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6064191,
    "dDurationMs": 40,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " Just need to be open to different possibilities and different ways of seeing things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6064231,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " Um, we need to break loose from all the confines of our past, um, and a lot of these social norms that we have, uh, need to really shift and change."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6065031,
    "dDurationMs": 860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " And the only way that that can happen is if people become more open to what is possible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6065891,
    "dDurationMs": 20,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm-hmm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6065911,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And learn to embrace that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6065911,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6065911,
    "dDurationMs": 140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " I think that is my new favorite word for the day."
