  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6149011,
    "dDurationMs": 19120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " And one of the links that I will send you is the link to, uh, for people, basically cisgender straight or gay people who are interested in learning more directly and having open conversations of forming this community."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6168131,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " We meet, we'll meet on Zoom monthly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6171711,
    "dDurationMs": 9560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " Uh, I put out a newsletter for the community and it's associated with the podcast demystifying the transgender journey."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6181271,
    "dDurationMs": 24960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " And the whole purpose of this, uh, community is to inform people, help people have a framework for comprehending the transgender world, and, uh, hopefully f- have a network, form a network of informed allies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6206231,
    "dDurationMs": 11220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " Because one of the things we will n- A- we as peop- transgender people will not succeed in existing in society without allies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6217451,
    "dDurationMs": 13360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " It's allies that help the gay community, it's going to be allies that help the transgender community become more part of society."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6230811,
    "dDurationMs": 17700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " It will take time, but I'm doing my part to actually try to make a difference and help people have a framework for comprehension and changing perspectives, and seeing what's possible."
